  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_1cfe8ad358e343a18210e751957fa899",
      "statement": "ADR-0031 splits device ownership by timing: frozen arms inside Trainer.fit (A1) are owned by Lightning via normal nn.Module registration plus dual-exclusion, while models staged outside Trainer.fit before the process group exists (A2) cannot be Lightning-managed and are routed through a DevicePolicy that resolves cuda:{LOCAL_RANK} from the launcher environment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0031-device-ownership.md#L12-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6d322d376bb9f9bc5b01c319f7317e38f957b0122977f3421c41c22b3f220152:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0035-devicepolicy-per-rank-device.md#L1-L13",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:81022b2566d2c4de82e4dc85b9c4cb061bd4c76871767a8a7731fcfcaebabfac:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2a75e67bf9a04bbfaaf226a0157bb113",
      "statement": "FrozenArmMixin._register_frozen_arm is the single place the frozen-arm prep is applied: it calls arm.eval(), sets requires_grad=False on the arm's parameters, registers the arm as a normal submodule via setattr, and unions the name into the instance-level _frozen_arm_names frozenset, so adding a frozen arm cannot forget the freeze.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/modules/frozen_arm.py#L44-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1407d79d4fd5fec8b3548dbd7b2f0236bce9798013b20338bb3a91e60dbf8733:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f753de213ce64b68b59657ade826b42b",
      "statement": "Registration is what lets Lightning own a frozen arm's device placement: a frozen arm is a plain registered nn.Module child (so Lightning's automatic .to(device) moves it per-rank) and the retired object.__setattr__ registration bypass and on_fit_start manual .to(self.device) moves are gone.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0031-device-ownership.md#L15-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cfed1b8fbd9d35d9cdfb4499e308e8c36b33d3bdcdcd3a05b1776bba3f238522:"
        },
        {
