      "statement": "Hosts must declare the mixin first in the MRO (class XModule(FrozenArmMixin, spt.Module)); the mixin's three dunder overrides then chain to nn.Module through cooperative super() because neither spt.Module nor pl.LightningModule overrides state_dict, load_state_dict, or train.",
