    {
      "id": "claim_13ba1e516bf940f6a5d00fce68a8a237",
      "statement": "DevicePolicy.pin() performs the single pre-PG set_device side effect with the twin's out-of-range guard: under CUDA it returns cuda:{local_rank} and calls set_device only when local_rank < device_count, and without CUDA it returns cpu with no side effects.",
      "evidence": [
