    {
      "id": "claim_7a80414e0931478ca6cb670657d29cce",
      "statement": "DevicePolicy is the constructed replacement for three duplicated pre-PG device decisions: the character-identical set_device twin in grpo_cli.main and reward_cli.main, the controlnet shell's bare cuda:0 literal, and the now-deleted latent_pipeline.resolve_warm_device free function used by the JiT and controlnet VAE warm closures.",
