    {
      "id": "claim_c93277a6ea8b4287b97a6d813659b064",
      "statement": "DevicePolicy owns only which device a rank uses, not how a model is staged onto it: the staging chain (.to(device).eval() plus requires_grad_(False)) belongs to the frozen-arm mechanism, and ADR-0035 keeps the two decoupled so either can be changed or deleted independently.",
