    {
      "id": "claim_ab8018bf66124e12968fe10355ab5ce2",
      "statement": "The grpo_cli, reward_cli, and controlnet_cli main() functions pin through DevicePolicy().pin() on the real path, while the data_provider CPU-smoke seam stays torch.device(\"cpu\") and constructs no DevicePolicy, so the smokes need no GPU and no launcher environment.",
