    {
      "id": "claim_fc7b90bd720c43dd9e5891fea96aa6a0",
      "statement": "The JiT shell does not pin: it captures the launch-time fallback torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\") and resolves the per-rank device only inside the post-PG warm closure, which re-stages the VAE onto warm_device and rebuilds the encode_fn bound to that device (the controlnet _real_inputs closure does the same).",
