      "statement": "Both mechanisms are locked by focused tests: the mixin's behavior contract by the seven tests in tests/test_frozen_arm_mixin.py plus the host-level dual-exclude proofs in tests/test_controlnet_module_training.py and tests/test_grpo.py; DevicePolicy's contract by tests/test_device_policy.py (env-var and dist monkeypatching, no real GPU) plus source-level inspect.getsource guards on the three shells' main() and the two warm closures in tests/test_ddp_warm.py, with a 2-rank spawn smoke asserting the ranks receive different per-rank devices.",
